# SECURITY.md advisories URL (issue #43 conformance): the private-vulnerability-reporting
# URL is the documented reporter handle and must ship verbatim; guarded.
regex:github\.com/jacobhausler/hermes-workflows/security/advisories

# Joint-eng-protocol SSOT pointer (AGENTS.md §4d / CONTRIBUTING.md footer): the
# citation must name the governing repo, file, digest, and public check mirror
# verbatim — the pointer IS the verification handle a cold reader checks; guarded.
regex:^Cross-estate joint eng protocol v1 is the SSOT
# One-owner check-guide pointer (references/development.md): CONTRIBUTING.md is not
# packaged in the release ZIP, so the shipped reference resolves the canonical gates
# block by public URL — the pointer IS the one-source handle; guarded verbatim.
regex:^\[CONTRIBUTING\.md\]\(https://github\.com/jacobhausler/hermes-workflows/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING\.md\)$
